;; ooyake 公 — authority-reference.edn
;;
;; A SMALL, BUNDLED, curated set of AUTHORITATIVE facts about government units —
;; the kind of record the R1 `reconcile` cell would otherwise FETCH from external
;; authorities (Wikidata / 行政機関コード / GeoNames). Bundled here so the
;; reconcile DEMO (reconcile.py) is runnable OFFLINE and deterministic; live
;; network fetch is G4 + Council + operator gated and is NOT what this file is.
;;
;; The reconcile cell promotes a seed unit :representative → :authoritative ONLY
;; when the unit's :gov.unit/wikidata AND :gov.unit/official-url both AGREE with
;; the authoritative record here (G5: agreement = verification, disagreement =
;; stays unverified + flagged). Each record cites its own provenance.

